{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/4a262398dd7da02e90828ab9f1ec27a5.poster.avif?t=1757696287\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/4a262398dd7da02e90828ab9f1ec27a5.webm?t=1757696287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/4a262398dd7da02e90828ab9f1ec27a5.mp4?t=1757696287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only one stopping an alien invasion... and loving every second of it! In this remake of 2014's <i>Wrack</i>, play as <strong>Kain</strong> as you shoot, slash, and <strong>hyperblast</strong> your way through a horde of invading <strong>aliens</strong> and <strong>robots</strong> to keep your planet safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/314f8a38da123d08c670ca05b4101fe7.webp?t=1757696287\" width=616 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill Streaks</strong>: Rack up kill after kill to earn a <strong>kill streak</strong>! The more damage you pump into an enemy, the more extreme its death, and the more time you have to keep your streak going.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resets</strong>: Kill enemies a second time by exploding their corpse into giblets to <strong>reset</strong> your timer! Use your current weapon(s), or your <strong>melee</strong> attack to slice a corpse to bits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Movement</strong>: Use your fast movement speed and abilities, like a <strong>super jump</strong>, to evade enemy attacks, and find <strong>secrets</strong> and <strong>treasure</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/1bb3c1ef22f91d0cc306cab8d4cdd78a.poster.avif?t=1757696287\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/1bb3c1ef22f91d0cc306cab8d4cdd78a.webm?t=1757696287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/1bb3c1ef22f91d0cc306cab8d4cdd78a.mp4?t=1757696287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong>: When you're done racking up a huge kill streak, duke it out with <strong>minibosses</strong> and <strong>bosses</strong>... and put your skills to the test!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/d1650f7c16b34096e1d660a1da9e3ea0.webp?t=1757696287\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Weapons</strong>: Expand your arsenal with the addition of the <strong>gloogun</strong>, <strong>SMG</strong>, and <strong>railgun</strong>! (The Pulsar will return...) In addition, all weapons now have an <strong>alternate fire</strong> giving you a richer, more in-depth experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/5c884ac6493f8e6373db24371dc80f39.poster.avif?t=1757696287\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/5c884ac6493f8e6373db24371dc80f39.webm?t=1757696287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/extras/5c884ac6493f8e6373db24371dc80f39.mp4?t=1757696287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyperblasts</strong>: Build them up by dealing damage, and then <i>unleash</i> your powerful <strong>hyperblasts</strong> to take down tough enemies, or wipe out groups of weak ones!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unreal Engine</strong>: <i>Wrack</i> has been remade in <strong>Unreal Engine 4</strong>, to give you the most optimized, high-fidelity experience possible.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo contains the first two levels (not counting the tutorial).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980700?t=1757696287","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/6aa7389ee44abaa2572c555c88f17489888df273/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757696287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/7055456125a4964110a9fedfc60c85c2ef7c2b2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757696287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980700/7055456125a4964110a9fedfc60c85c2ef7c2b2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757696287","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}]