5513ac2ce92b1c3829cf52e3.600x338.jpg?t=1757696287"}],"short_description":"Inspired by classics like DOOM and Quake, Wrack is an arcade-style FPS. Mow down enemies one after another, and become more powerful the more you kill.\u00a0Amass a deadly arsenal, discover secret powers... and save your world!","steam_appid":3980700,"support_info":{"email":"bmc431@gmail.com","url":"http://www.wrackgame.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":null}